## Where to dig deeper

- `appmap.sqlite` — the full map; schema, vocabularies and query recipes in `SCHEMA.md`.
- `appmap.json` — the same tables as one JSON document (crawl-internal tables left out).
- `events.jsonl` — every action and observation; `*_event` / `event_id` columns point here.
- `traffic/<role>.har`, `bodies/`, `artifacts/` — raw HTTP, large bodies, screenshots and DOM.
- `appmap query --run <run> <recipe>` with recipes `flows`, `forms-posting-to`,
  `hidden-but-reachable`, `endpoint-shape`, `path-to-state`, `role-matrix`, `gaps`.

Example queries:

```sh
sqlite3 appmap.sqlite "SELECT name, role FROM flows"
sqlite3 appmap.sqlite "SELECT method, path_pattern, kind FROM endpoints WHERE kind != 'static'"
sqlite3 appmap.sqlite "SELECT * FROM role_access WHERE outcome = 'allowed'"
```
